'Reetwika Banerjee writes poetry, fiction, travel narratives and practical guides to digital safety. Her work brings together a literary practice and a professional background in information security. Evincepub’s catalogue includes her travel book Mystic Himalayas and Cyber Security at Your Finger Tips; her article for the Goethe-Institut explains online cookies and personal privacy to general readers.',
